00:19:40.440 --> 00:19:42.660
but also like, yeah, it's an issue.

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:45.180
I don't think I would have much of,

00:19:45.340 --> 00:19:48.600
I'd have as much of a problem of like going and selecting it.

00:19:49.740 --> 00:19:53.040
