00:20:43.920 --> 00:20:46.360
And of course, the ranks were in Metal Gear 1.

00:20:46.520 --> 00:20:48.740
The way that works is that as your rank goes up

00:20:48.740 --> 00:20:51.620
from one star, two star, I think all the way up to six stars,

