00:20:56.700 --> 00:20:57.560
That is true.

00:20:59.240 --> 00:21:00.800
True, but what'd you think of the truth gas?

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:03.340
Did you, oh wait, was I using the truth gas on you there?

